1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
And B and C need a dynamic
of domination and submission.

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:03,800
It can reverse, of course.

3
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:08,000
At times, you can both
let the tension go.

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,800
At times C moves above,
with B below.

5
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:15,000
None of that is fixed yet.

6
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,600
But A can’t see either of them.

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:18,400
You stay outside,
listening to their dialogue.
